<title>SPAIN: BCH DATA SEES SPAIN 78 PCT LIKELY IN EMU LAUNCH.</title>
<headline>BCH DATA SEES SPAIN 78 PCT LIKELY IN EMU LAUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial markets were on Tuesday discounting a 78.4 percent chance that Spain will join the launch of European economic and monetary union (EMU) in 1999, according to an indicator from Banco Central Hispano.</p>
<p>This rate is down from  82.56 percent at the start of February.</p>
<p>The &quot;Euro thermometer&quot; is based on the fixed portion of swaps rates.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
